# My Readiness

Farmer-facing KaLI Coop portal: public, no-login mobile PWA.
Lookup by member number, phone, or national ID. Stateless per visit.

## This repo owns

- Display-ready readiness UI (Score / Loan / Improve)
- Localization (en, sw; more later via i18n keys — never hardcode copy)
- Action self-report forwarding
- Kali voice greeting playback for the selected locale

## This repo does NOT own

- Scoring or action ranking — the Agricultural Credit Platform backend owns that
- Officer / field-verification tooling
- Auth or sessions

## Architecture

Frontend → core platform (`/api/readiness/...`) which shapes and localizes.
Scoring stays in `CreditEngineService`. My Readiness never invents a score.

Same Express app as farmers/loans/produce (`backend/`, port 3000).
Registered farmers (national ID, phone, member number) come from Firestore.
Until Firebase is configured, or if the lookup is unknown, demo profiles in
`my-readiness/backend/src/clients/corePlatform.js` still answer.

## Product rules

- Self-report does **not** change the score. Copy must say so.
- No nested phone mockup. Score is a flat card.
- Loan amount is server-calculated and read-only.
- Verified = officer confirmed; pending = self-reported or not yet confirmed.
- Mobile-first, thumb-sized targets, bottom tab nav, skeleton loaders, cache last profile.

See `my-readiness/PROJECT.md` for API contracts and screen list.
